From 2956caafbf11d173ec64dd815fd66c5e93212fd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnSnow <110465696+JohnSnow14284@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 20:26:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/23] Add distant Create & Sable LOD integrations

Large feature and robustness update: adds a Python mixin validator and build gating; improves Create compatibility (distant trains/contraptions/kinetics) with new classes (KineticSnapshots, FlywheelVisuals, SectionReingestQueue, bind/accessor mixins), upgrades ContraptionStore format, and refines contraption tracking/retirement. Implements beacon solver/tracker and renderer improvements with retry semantics. Adds Sable LOD ticketing and parent-chunk light sync, section caching hints, and many performance/handoff fixes (light sampling peek/warmup, kinetic capture budget, shader/leaf handoff, config limits and language updates). Misc mixin and resource adjustments for stability and correctness.
